<title>NEW ZEALAND: FORECAST - Consensus of NZ June quarter GDP data.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus of NZ June quarter GDP data.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of economists' forecasts for June quarter GDP data due on Friday September 27 from Statistics New Zealand.</p>
<p>Note - averages are rounded.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>GDP - PRODUCTION BASED</p>
<p>		    Real s/a qtr   Real s/a yr    Actual average pct</p>
<p>change in yr to June</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AMP		 +0.4	     +1.8		  +2.3</p>
<p>    ANZ		 +0.4	     +1.8		  +2.3</p>
<p>    ASB		 +0.3	     +1.6		  +2.3</p>
<p>    BAIN		+0.5	     +1.8		  +2.4</p>
<p>    BT		  +0.7	     +2.4		  +2.1</p>
<p>    FIRST NZ	  +0.6	     +2.0		  +2.4</p>
<p>    GARLICK	   +0.3	     +1.6		  +2.3</p>
<p>    NATIONAL	  +0.4	     +1.8		  +2.3</p>
<p>    WARBURG	   +0.5	     +1.9		  +2.4</p>
<p>    WESTPAC	   +0.1	     +1.4		  +2.3</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	   +0.4	     +1.8		  +2.3</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>GDP - EXPENDITURE BASED</p>
<p>		     Real s/a qtr  Real s/a yr   Actual average pct</p>
<p>							  change in yr to June</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AMP		  +0.5	     +1.2		  +0.8</p>
<p>    ANZ		  +0.4	     +1.1		  +1.9</p>
<p>    ASB		   n/a		n/a		   n/a</p>
<p>    BAIN		  n/a		n/a		   n/a</p>
<p>    BT		    n/a		n/a		   n/a</p>
<p>    FIRST NZ	   +1.3	     +2.0		  +1.3</p>
<p>    GARLICK	    +0.6	     +1.3		  +0.8</p>
<p>    NATIONAL	   +0.4	     +1.1		  +1.0</p>
<p>    WARBURG	     n/a		n/a		   n/a</p>
<p>    WESTPAC	    +0.2	     +0.9		  +1.0</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	   +0.57	    +1.27		 +1.13</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
